# NOTE: .env is intentionally committed. pubspec.yaml bundles it as an asset,
# so without it in the repo every GitHub / Codespace build produces an app with
# no GEMINI_API_KEY and silently falls back to on-device OCR. The key ships
# inside the APK either way (see gemini_ocr_service.dart), so keeping it out of
# git bought nothing and broke every off-laptop build.
